					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Accepi tua omnia, pro quibus etiam gratias <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>quas possum ago maximas, et oro, ut <persName>Dietägio</persName>, viro <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>praeclaro, meo nomine gratias agas pro scripto.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Accepi item <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>excusationem tuam tui silentii; nam cum mea inspicio, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>disco aliis quoque c redere; et nunc quidem ita sum <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>delassatus negotiis et his nihilominus nondum absolutis <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>impexus, ut brevibus orem hisce sis contentus.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Quae nova habemus, his inclusi.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Celebrantur comitia <lb xml:id="p1z10"/><placeName ref="l760">Saloduri</placeName> ob postulata regis, qui petit sibi legionem <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>mitti <placeName ref="l862">Helveticam</placeName>, 6000, quasi vero satis non <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>sit tot milia perdidisse, nisi adhuc plures pariter <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>perdendi submittantur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Nostri et <placeName ref="l41">Bernenses</placeName> gravissimis <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>additis poenis militiam hanc suis prohibent.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/><placeName ref="l646">Claronenses</placeName> nec legatum misere ad comitia nec <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ullum regi dabunt militem, sic etiam <placeName ref="l28">Basilienses</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>et <placeName ref="l441">Schaffhusiani</placeName>; graviter et hi suis prohibent <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>militiam, utpote impiam.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Perge ergo et tu tuum <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>facere officium, sicuti nos hic quoque facimu<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>s.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Episcopus <placeName ref="l257">Constantiensis</placeName> dicitur spargere posta ad se delatum esse iterum <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>in <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> esse pugnatum et vicisse regem cruenta <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>victoria.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">Ich warten des hinckenden bottens.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Oremus <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>dominum, vigilem ecclesiae, ut nos servet fluctuantes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Vale aeternum.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta d. consules, d. <persName ref="p1770">Gregorium Carolum</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/><persName ref="p6130">Pontasellam</persName>, <persName ref="p20473">Ganthnerum</persName>, d. <persName ref="p2776">Ruynellam</persName> et alios nostros amicos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> 19. augusti 1569.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta domum tuam.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Mei quoque te tuosque salutant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Festinantissime scripsi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Tuus <persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Ornatissimo viro d. <persName ref="p8016">Tobiae <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Eglio</persName>, <placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ministro fidelissimo, domino <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>et fratri meo honorando <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>et dilectissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>